      "statement": "IndexTTS2.infer_generator runs the whole pipeline in one generator: cached speaker and emotion conditioning, optional emotion-vector mixing, text preparation and segmentation, the merged emotion vector, then per segment GPT generation, codec decoding, length regulation, flow-matching mel generation and BigVGAN vocoding.",
